// The Threshold (bible 7.2 climax, 6.3, 6.11; character-bibles.md §1, §8). Two rooms: the Guild's line (Threshold_1),
// where Halvard fights a third time and stops counting, and the line itself (Threshold_2), where Voss gives the
// game's one speech. He brought tethers to go in himself at last; he has stood here since dawn and not stepped.
// His speech reads what Wren has done: Pell's report, the audience, the stones she carries, the Steppe's survey.
// Voss: formal, exact, titles, "we" for the Guild; flinches at "Halloway"; does not say "Corra".

title: Threshold_Halvard
---
<<if has_flag("act2.halvard_third")>>
    Halvard: A survey. I entered it as a survey. The first I've written. #still #face:bright #line:0d3f078
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<if has_flag("boss.halvard_3.defeated")>>
    Halvard: Go. I'll enter it as a survey. #line:078f229
    Halvard: Wardens. Lances down. This is a survey now. Nobody counts her. #line:00be0df
    <<flag act2.halvard_third 1>>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Halvard: The count ends here, journeyman. #still #face:wary #line:01e892f
<<if has_flag("act2.halvard_second")>>
    Halvard: Three paces at the lighthouse. Four on the bridges. None here. I counted every one. #still #face:wary #line:06beaba
<<else>>
    Halvard: The bridges missed you. The line will not. #still #face:wary #line:0ae1325
<<endif>>
-> Count me, then. #line:09ea08a
    Halvard: One. That's all you were to them. One. #still #face:grave #line:0ea71ab
    <<voice warden greyfold>>
-> You don't want to be here. #line:0af8ffa
    Halvard: No. I want to be home, counting gulls. Lance up. #still #face:grave #line:045bd9d
    <<voice surveyor greyfold>>
-> ... #line:04069a5
    Halvard: Silence. You learned that from me. Good. #still #face:bright #line:0e3c7c4
    <<voice drift greyfold>>
<<flag threshold.halvard.spoken 1>>
===

title: Threshold_Voss
---
<<if has_flag("boss.voss.defeated")>>
    <<if has_flag("greyfold.crossed")>>
        Voss: Go, journeyman. The line is yours now. #still #face:grave #line:030ecda
    <<else>>
        Voss: Take it in. Tell her— no. Nothing. Go. #plant:5.5 #face:grave #line:0436dfd
        Voss: I will be here. I have been here forty-one years. A little longer costs nothing. #face:grave #line:096c1dc
        <<flag greyfold.crossed 1>>
    <<endif>>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<if has_flag("threshold.voss.spoken")>>
    Voss: We are past speeches, journeyman. Take up your quill. #still #face:wary #line:08b37fa
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Voss: Journeyman Halloway. This is as far as the map goes. #plant:5.4 #face:wary #line:00180ea
<<if has_flag("pell.report_sent")>>
    Voss: Your minder writes well. I have read the report four times. #face:wary #line:0207179
<<elseif has_flag("pell.report_kept")>>
    Voss: Your minder filed nothing on you. Pell has not once filed late. We noticed. #face:wary #line:06189a1
<<endif>>
<<if flag("halden.maren.decided") == 1>>
    Voss: The Crown tells me you will make Halden permanent. Then help us hold it. #line:0ae2db6
<<elseif flag("halden.maren.decided") == 2>>
    Voss: The Queen-Regent says you refused her. So have we, often. #line:09306b2
<<elseif flag("halden.maren.decided") == 3>>
    Voss: You told the Queen-Regent about the boy. That was not yours to tell. #callback:5.1 #face:wary #line:0e235dd
<<endif>>
<<if keystones() >= 3>>
    Voss: Three stones. More. You have emptied half of Aurenne into your pack. #face:wary #line:0e70872
<<elseif keystones() >= 1>>
    Voss: You carry the kingdom's stones. They belong in the Vault, in the slots we keep. #face:wary #line:087be0f
<<else>>
    Voss: You carry no stones. Good. Then we have nothing to take from you. #line:0ce26f1
<<endif>>
<<if has_flag("windreach.hale.finished")>>
    Voss: Hale's survey of the Steppe is on my desk. Even the clans hold still for paper. #line:0e9033d
<<elseif has_flag("boss.hale.defeated")>>
    Voss: Hale came home without his lens. He will not say why. We did not ask. #face:wary #line:07a9e9c
<<endif>>
Voss: Forty-one years we have held this line. Not one more town has gone into the white. #line:0ca1596
Voss: I brought tethers today. Forty. I meant to go in myself, this morning. #face:grave #line:0f8e1a2
Voss: I have stood here since dawn. I cannot say why I have not. #plant:5.5 #face:grave #line:006c6d1
Voss: So nobody crosses. Not you. Not with the kingdom's stones. We hold. That is what we are for. #face:wary #line:003d230
-> Come in with me. #line:0b6eb2c
    Voss: No. Somebody must hold the line. #face:wary #line:052883e
    <<voice drift greyfold>>
-> Who's in there you won't see? #line:0a385bc
    Voss: Nobody. Nothing. Take up your quill, journeyman. #plant:5.5 #face:wary #line:0cacfd5
    <<voice surveyor greyfold>>
-> Stand aside, Guildmaster. #line:071cfb0
    Voss: Then we will see which of us the map remembers. #face:wary #line:0a97689
    <<voice warden greyfold>>
<<flag threshold.voss.spoken 1>>
===

title: Threshold_Pell_Cross
---
<<if not has_flag("pell.report_kept")>>
    Threshold: The Wardens' line, broken. Tethers dropped on the white. Nobody from the Hall came. #still #line:0dd2a9e
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<if not has_flag("boss.voss.defeated")>>
    Pell: He's right there. Which, technically, means you're not across yet. I'll wait. I'm good at it. #still #line:0eba8f0
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<if has_flag("pell.at_threshold")>>
    Pell: Go on. I'm writing. I'm a fast writer. #still #face:bright #line:00757ec
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Pell: Three things. Your name. Isolde's. And whoever's in there. #face:grave #line:05a7f2e
Pell: Go on. I'll write it down. #face:bright #line:03ad242
-> Write it plainly. #line:0b5e199
    Pell: I only know how to write it plainly. That was the whole problem, once. #face:bright #line:0ff51d1
    <<voice surveyor greyfold>>
-> Come with me. #line:0f0e0b3
    Pell: I can't. Someone has to be here when you come back. It's going to be me. #face:bright #line:0ad024c
    <<voice warden greyfold>>
-> ... #line:07cfae9
    Pell: Yes. Fine. That too. I'll write the silence down. #face:bright #line:03b1960
    <<voice drift greyfold>>
<<flag pell.at_threshold 1>>
===
